    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Trade Route 45, Pitstop H; a remote, dumping ground planet, we hope you enjoy your stay.<br />\r\nWhile here why not enjoy the numerous perks this planet has to offer, including:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRoving bands of defective but deadly robots.<br />\r\nA sprawling web of interconnected paths to explore.<br />\r\nPowerful artefacts that expand your combat and traversal capabilities.<br />\r\nChallenging rooms to test your dexterity and agility.<br />\r\nColourful locals to meet that are only slightly decrepit.<br />\r\nAn oppressive overlord and his subordinates, all highly willing to engage you in battle.<br />\r\nA lack of humans, like a weirdly absolute lack of any human life.",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to Trade Route 45, Pitstop H; a remote, dumping ground planet, we hope you enjoy your stay.<br />\r\nWhile here why not enjoy the numerous perks this planet has to offer, including:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRoving bands of defective but deadly robots.<br />\r\nA sprawling web of interconnected paths to explore.<br />\r\nPowerful artefacts that expand your combat and traversal capabilities.<br />\r\nChallenging rooms to test your dexterity and agility.<br />\r\nColourful locals to meet that are only slightly decrepit.<br />\r\nAn oppressive overlord and his subordinates, all highly willing to engage you in battle.<br />\r\nA lack of humans, like a weirdly absolute lack of any human life.",
    "short_description": "Explore Trash Heart, a planet in the iron grip of the Trash Lord. Find artefacts that grant powerful abilities, fight hordes of deadly foes, and save a planet of outcast robots. Or just scrounge up all the trash your grubby little raccoon hands can hold.",
